# docker 构建上下文瘦身(后端/前端镜像均以仓库根为上下文)。
# 注意:保留 backend/ 与 data-juicer/ 源码,仅剔除无关或可重建的重物。

# VCS / 编辑器
**/.git
**/.gitignore
**/.vscode
**/.idea
**/.DS_Store

# 可重建依赖与缓存
**/node_modules
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.mypy_cache
frontend/dist
frontend/.umi
frontend/.umi-production

# 本仓库非镜像所需的大件
dashboard
docs
.claude
.omc
**/.omc

# data-juicer:剔除非运行所需的大目录(保留 data_juicer 包源码 + pyproject + README)
data-juicer/.git
data-juicer/.venv
data-juicer/.understand-anything
data-juicer/tests
data-juicer/demos
data-juicer/docs
data-juicer/outputs
data-juicer/.github
data-juicer/dist

# 机密 / 本地态
backend/.env
backend/var
deploy/.env
**/*.log
